<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">11052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran rejected Washington's ceasefire terms as American jets crippled two more Iranian tankers stranded in the Strait of Hormuz.</s> <s>Trump called Tehran's counteroffer — bundling sanctions relief and Hormuz management with the nuclear file — totally unacceptable.</s> <s>Seventy tankers worth more than thirteen billion dollars sit immobilised at the strait, and the war's diplomatic and kinetic tracks have collapsed into a single confrontation.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A militant coalition calling itself Ittehad-ul-Mujahideen bombed a police checkpoint in Bannu, then sent quadcopter drones against the reinforcements that arrived, killing fifteen officers.</s> <s>The three-faction alliance, formed only last April, is the first group on Pakistan's Afghan border to fold attack drones into a standing tactical doctrine.</s> <s>Islamabad blames Kabul for the safe havens, and no ceasefire holds along that frontier.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hungary's new Prime Minister Péter Magyar refused to shelter Poland's former justice minister Zbigniew Ziobro within hours of taking office.</s> <s>Ziobro — accused of leading an organised criminal enterprise inside the Polish state — landed in Newark on revoked Polish passports as Warsaw prepared an American extradition request.</s> <s>Magyar's first move dismantled the regional sanctuary architecture Orbán had built for allies under investigation.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Thaksin Shinawatra walked out of Klong Prem prison Monday, paroled after the king commuted his sentence and he served two-thirds of what remained.</s> <s>His daughter Paetongtarn lost the premiership last August as Pheu Thai — the machine he built over a quarter-century — posted its worst-ever election result.</s> <s>Whether Thailand's military tolerates Thaksin's return to backroom politics will decide the country's next year.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South African police arrested the heads of the Hawks and the Crime Intelligence division — the country's two apex investigative units — among fifteen senior officers due in court this week.</s> <s>Both generals appeared at Kempton Park Monday; suspended Police Commissioner Masemola is next.</s> <s>The arrests reach deeper into the security establishment than any post-apartheid corruption case so far.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Vladimir Putin called an Armenian referendum on European Union membership logical — a striking concession from the patron Yerevan once relied on for survival.</s> <s>Russia failed twice to defend Armenia from Azerbaijan, and Yerevan froze its Collective Security Treaty seat in twenty twenty-four before signing a two-and-a-half-billion-euro deal with Brussels this month.</s> <s>The alliance meets on the twenty-sixth, possibly without one of its founders.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Latvia's defence minister Andris Spruds resigned after Russian electronic jamming pushed two drones onto Latvian soil.</s> <s>Prime Minister Silina said the public had lost trust; Kyiv pledged Baltic cooperation on jamming countermeasures, but no shared intercept protocol exists yet.</s> <s>NATO's eastern flank is now absorbing the spillover from a war it isn't formally in.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Benjamin Netanyahu told an American broadcaster he wants Israel's three-point-eight-billion-dollar annual American military aid drawn down to zero within a decade, replaced by Gulf alliances.</s> <s>The current thirty-eight-billion-dollar commitment runs through twenty twenty-eight.</s> <s>A sitting Israeli prime minister is signalling that the post-nineteen-seventy-nine aid architecture has reached political end-of-life.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>France's Africa summit opened Monday in Nairobi — the first time Paris has convened it in an anglophone capital.</s> <s>French troops were expelled from base after base across the Sahel; Kenya is now France's primary strategic partner on the continent.</s> <s>Whether francophone Africa returns to that table at all will define what's left of Paris's African policy.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Treasurer Jim Chalmers built Australia's Tuesday budget around Iran-war disruption — the first major G-twenty fiscal package to put the war on the cover.</s> <s>A two-and-a-half-billion-dollar fuel-excise cut leads the headline measures, while negative gearing for property investors is wound back for the first time in a generation.</s> <s>Treasury still forecasts higher inflation and unemployment.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Narendra Modi told a crowd in Hyderabad to cut fuel use, gold buying, and foreign travel — three of India's largest forex outflows.</s> <s>New Delhi spends roughly sixteen hundred crore rupees a day holding pump prices steady, and that subsidy is bleeding the reserves.</s> <s>The patriotism framing softens what analysts read as a coming round of duty hikes and quiet rationing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>All two hundred seventy-seven passengers escaped uninjured after a Turkish Airlines A-three-thirty caught fire on its right landing gear in Kathmandu, closing Nepal's only international runway.</s> <s>Tribhuvan handles every flight into the country; a second runway has neither funding nor a construction date.</s> <s>A landing-gear failure can isolate thirty million people from international commerce for more than a day.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Belgium's Queen Mathilde opened a five-day economic mission to Türkiye on Saturday — Brussels' first major bilateral push to Ankara in fourteen years.</s> <s>The agenda covers defence, energy, and logistics.</s> <s>Türkiye's ambassador called it the start of a new bilateral chapter as Europe scrambles for non-American defence suppliers.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A neonatal unit in Shenyang found that brain-injury risk in preterm infants accelerates nonlinearly above forty-nine picograms per millilitre of cord-blood interleukin-six — an inflection the standard linear screen misses entirely.</s> <s>The Chinese cohort tracked more than a thousand infants born under thirty-two weeks.</s> <s>African and Asian neonatal units that follow Western linear-threshold guidelines may be misclassifying their highest-risk babies.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>VPN apps surged to the top of Britain's download charts the day its age-verification law took effect, and the European Parliamentary Research Service now calls them a loophole that needs closing.</s> <s>Researchers in Brussels propose extending age checks to VPN access itself.</s> <s>This is how a children's-protection mandate becomes a continent-wide architecture for monitoring who reaches the open internet.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An EfficientNet model scored ninety-four percent overall accuracy and a perfect score on physical damage detection in solar-panel inspection, a Nature paper reports.</s> <s>The system replaces walk-the-array technicians at industrial scale.</s> <s>For Egypt, Morocco, and India — the three nations now installing solar fastest — automated inspection collapses the maintenance cost curve that has kept utility-scale solar out of reach.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>